==Battleground==
*1 [[Codename "Red Riding"]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*5 [[Tackey]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*4 [[Mr. Mole]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The key to this stage is SPEED. Bring units that are as fast as possible, to sneak through the blindspots of Red Riding, Tackey and Mr. Mole. [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]] is a good cat on this level and so are [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] and, especially, [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Cleanerbot Cat]]. Spawning Manic Lions as quickly as possible can overwhelm the Elder Sloth, leaving the rest of the enemies vulnerable to their own blind spots.

Remember to time your units well so Red Riding doesn't snipe them. Additionally, Mr. Mole's [[Knockback|knockback]] will affect all Cats that are not immune, and thus can be abused to reset the attack animations of cats with long backswing, most notably Maglev Cat.

==='''Rush Strategy'''===
{{Lineup
|Neneko
|Moneko
